    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d239-a2">

                <pb facs="0273" n="259" xml:id="pg259"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Agenda Suggested by Hurley</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chungking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-08">8 September 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>The paramount objective of Chinese-American collaboration is to bring
                        about a unification of all military forces in China for the immediate defeat
                        of Japan and the liberation of China.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>To cooperate with China in bringing about closer relations and harmony
                        with Russia and Britain for the support of the Chinese objectives.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>The unification of all military forces under the command of the
                        Generalissimo.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>The marshaling of all resources in China for war purposes.</item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>Support efforts of Generalissimo for political unification of
                        China.</item>
                    <label>6.</label>
                    <item>Submit present and postwar economic plans for China.</item>
                    <label>7.</label>
                    <item>Definition of the powers of General Stilwell as Field Commander.</item>
                    <label>8.</label>
                    <item>Definition of General Stilwell’s powers as Chief of Staff to the
                        Generalissimo.</item>
                    <label>9.</label>
                    <item>Prepare for presentation a diagram of command.</item>
                    <label>10.</label>
                    <item>Discuss future control of lend lease in China.</item>
                </list>
                <p>(Tentative agenda received by Ambassador from Gen. Hurley on September 11,
                    1944.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
